	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event0_enemy_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>E『みての　とおり……▼
おまえたち　にんげんに　いわせれば
うちゅうじん……　エイリアンだ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>E『みての　通り……▼
お前たち　人間に　言わせれば
宇宙人……　エイリアンだ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-12-01T03:50:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-12-01T03:50:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event0_hero_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『なぜ　にんげんに
ばけて　わたしに　ちかづいたの……？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『なぜ　人間に
化けて　私に　近づいたの……？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
